  "title": "Television: James Paul McCartney | 1973",
  "date": "1973-03-27",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Filming for the television special <em>James Paul McCartney</em> continued on 27 March 1973 at Elstree Studios. <span id=\"more-133407\"></span></p><p><a href=\"/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_06/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-133386\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iODE2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDgxNiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"133386\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_06/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_06.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1600,1632\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_06-941x960.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_06-941x960.jpg\" alt=\"James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" width=\"800\" height=\"816\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-133386\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_06-941x960.jpg 941w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_06-569x580.jpg 569w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_06-196x200.jpg 196w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_06-768x783.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_06-1506x1536.jpg 1506w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_06.jpg 1600w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p><p>This day’s sequence was based around an unreleased <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> song, ‘Gotta Sing, Gotta Dance’. It was commissioned in 1972 by Twiggy for a proposed film musical of the same title, which was never made.</p><p>The version used in <em>James Paul McCartney</em> was scored by Jack Parnell, the musical director, who conducted his orchestra dna vocal group The Ladybirds.</p><p>The sequence was filmed in two parts. The first had McCartney at a piano, before giving way to an elaborate dance number. McCartney was filmed alone against a blue screen, and 35 dancers were later composited. McCartney’s dance moves were choreographed by Robert Iscove.</p><p>Produced by ATV, <em>James Paul McCartney</em> was first broadcast on 16 April 1973 in the USA, and 10 May in the UK. It was released on DVD as part of the super deluxe reissue of in <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/albums/red-rose-speedway/\"><em>Red Rose Speedway</em></a> December 2018.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1973/03/27/television-james-paul-mccartney-13/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-133407 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Wings in the James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-580x577.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-960x955.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-768x764.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-1536x1528.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01.jpg 1600w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"133381\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1600,1592\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Wings in the James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-960x955.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-580x577.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-960x955.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-768x764.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-1536x1528.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02.jpg 1600w\"